WEBVTT

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:45.740
Okay, let's go.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.690
Poring.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.600
Alice-<i>chan</i>?

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:14.130
Alice-<i>chan</i>!

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:24.150
<i>♪ Sleep now, dear child ♪</i>

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:33.050
<i>♪ Rest easy ♪</i>

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:37.860
<i>♪ Sleep now, my child ♪</i>

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.800
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:45.770
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:48.270
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:52.770
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:58.580
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:02.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:10.630
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:17.930
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:23.470
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:30.610
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:36.080
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.520
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:45.460
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.730
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:51.800
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:54.300
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:58.840
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:04.650
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:07.550
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.860
I did it!

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.360
Nice shot!

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:50.310
Holy Cross!

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.960
What's the matter, Lin?!
What're you waiting for?!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.730
It's no use...

00:03:57.730 --> 00:04:00.130
No matter how much we fight,

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:05.910
the sound of that bell brings them back to life without a scar!

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.380
Fighting is a waste of time!

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.750
Then what can we do?!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.980
What about Fayon?!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.750
I...

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.290
Damn!

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:20.880
Reflect...

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.790
Shield!

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.620
Shield...

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:33.470
...Boomerang!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.940
There's no end to them!

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.040
What the hell's going on?

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.980
Thunder Storm!

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.150
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.220
Cold Bolt!

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:58.430
See that? Takius-<i>san</i> is trying her best!

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.900
Are you just going to give up?!

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:14.080
That's more like it!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.150
Very good, Takius-<i>kun...</i>

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:24.220
Just a little more...

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.050
<i>Sensei</i>!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:31.060
Soon, the ultimate truth will be mine...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.930
Destroy those monsters...

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.430
Each time they come back, send them back to their deaths...

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:40.130
Over, and over again...

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:42.770
I won't do it!

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.210
What?!

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.840
Answer my question.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:51.610
Pluck away the seeds of doubt that have sprouted in my heart!

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:58.990
Why do the evil ones know of you, <i>Sensei</i>?

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:02.990
<i>Sensei,</i> what is the ultimate truth that you seek?

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:07.890
What of our promise that we made that day, that time, at that place?

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.570
Good morning, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:20.440
<i>Sensei</i>!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.110
Did you sleep well?

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.180
Y-Yes...

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:28.680
Takius-<i>kun</i>, I truly understand how you feel...

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.320
Does that mean?

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.220
Let us seek the ultimate truth together...

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:35.660
For the sake of all mankind.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:36.620
Yes!

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:42.930
Wasn't our promise to save all mankind?

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:48.370
Then shouldn't we also try to save their souls, as well?

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:55.070
That was the reason why
Yuufa sought new powers!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.050
You seem to have a mind of your own now...

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:04.620
All you should be doing is what I tell you.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:05.610
Are you implying...

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:11.420
I am merely your pawn, <i>Sensei</i>?

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:15.990
Holy Cross!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.070
What's the matter, Takius-<i>san</i>?!

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:23.470
Roan!

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.310
Fight, Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:34.120
Fight to your heart's content, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.320
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.590
Go ahead, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:38.850
No!

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.550
I am not your plaything!

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.830
Retreat!

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:17.490
Concentrate your fire at the exit!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:23.960
Shield boomerang!

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.440
We don't stand a chance!

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.810
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:37.300
I understand now...

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:45.220
Our game is over, Catherine.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.880
<i>Sensei?</i>

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.430
Zephyrus <i>Sensei</i>?!

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:01.930
Stand there and watch me!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:12.280
You seem lost, little one.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.680
What is it you seek?

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.750
More power...

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:21.290
...to give peace to souls seeking salvation.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.790
Very well.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:27.830
But first, you must pass several tests.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.830
Powers are not given to you.

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:32.390
They must be earned.

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:37.910
Go.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:42.280
Ahead of you are the tests you must overcome.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.350
What the-

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:32.890
Zephyrus <i>Sensei</i>!

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:35.000
<i>Sensei</i>? He's your <i>Sensei</i>?!

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.670
Did he come to help us?

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.600
I-I'm not sure...

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:42.540
Quagmire!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.600
Sightrasher!

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.450
I-Incredible!

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.750
I see why he's your <i>Sensei</i>!

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.860
Heaven's Drive!

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:10.860
Stop it...

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:13.700
Please stop!

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:14.960
Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.970
Stop it!

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:39.830
Who's there?

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:41.800
Is someone there?

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.730
Big Brother?

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.140
I can't see a thing...

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.040
Can't hear a thing...

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:55.680
Pain... it hurts so much...

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:58.450
Why must we all kill one another?

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.470
Why must we all hate one another?

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:07.690
This... isn't my real Big Brother?

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:10.830
Is there no peace for the soul in this world?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.690
Is this world filled only with despair?

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.260
It's not like that.

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.360
I will save those who are suffering...

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:21.000
Those who seek salvation...

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.700
No, you can't!

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:36.580
This world is filled with malice.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:41.560
The land, the air and the heavens have been poisoned.

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:47.830
Those who live there ingest the poison by breathing the air and eating food.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:54.460
To live means to taint your body and soul.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:03.910
You are already tainted.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:06.610
Why are you here?

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:10.420
Self-sacrifice?
Altruistic love? Philanthropy?

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:11.950
Of course not!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:15.560
What you feel in your soul is self-satisfaction.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:19.260
You want others to praise you; you want to feel useful...

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:21.020
Egotistical self-love is all it is.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:25.360
That's not so... that's not...

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:32.610
Are you frustrated because Roan's not making a fuss over you anymore?

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:34.380
Can't stand seeing someone

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:39.580
who used to come wagging his tail at your every smile surpass you?

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:40.680
No...

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:42.120
No... No!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.720
That's not so!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.810
I... I!

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:01.330
Fire Pillar!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:14.370
Meteor Storm!

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.870
Wonderful!

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.540
I feel full of power.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:40.340
Life is flowing into me.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:43.210
Just a little more until the ultimate truth.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:46.750
<i>Sensei...</i>

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:50.120
Fire Wall!

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:00.890
Is this what I have done?!

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:18.680
They're coming back again!

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:26.190
It's no use, I'm out of arrows.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.450
So am I.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:43.370
Don't you ever give up?!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.870
Holy Cross!

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:56.450
Shield Boomerang!

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:01.020
Oh no!

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:13.890
Duck!

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.240
Who're you?

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:24.580
This way, quickly!

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:56.940
Why'd you stop me?

00:16:56.940 --> 00:17:00.210
You couldn't have beaten them anyway.

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:05.350
Here.

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:17.620
What...

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.340
What is that bell?

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:25.840
When it rings, the monsters come back to life.

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:28.040
We keep killing them, but there's no end.

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:31.050
Wolyafa.

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.380
Huh?

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:35.920
One of a tribe of sorcerers that lives in the fallen capital.

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:41.720
Her bell lets her manipulate at will the souls of the dead who cling to this world.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.880
I see... So she's the root of the evil!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:40.380
If I defeat Wolyafa, they won't come back to life.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.450
Thank you. I can handle it now.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:44.820
Just a minute.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:48.780
You can't win simply by swinging your sword with all your might.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.830
Try cutting that.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:55.960
Why?

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:58.430
Just do it!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.570
What's the big deal?

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.900
I just have to do it, right?

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.050
What?

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.080
One more time!

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:33.390
Do you know why you couldn't cut the bamboo?

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:41.070
Bamboo doesn't fight force with force.

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:44.010
It accepts your force and flows with it.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:50.420
In this world, might isn't everything.

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.420
--Then...
--Huh?

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:54.550
Then what should I do?

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:00.460
Don't be such a wimp...

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:03.090
Find the answer yourself.

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.630
Admit it.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:41.340
You are the vile embodiment of egotistical self-love!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:45.570
Admit you are unworthy of helping others.

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:56.520
You're right... I only think about myself...

00:20:56.520 --> 00:21:01.650
I cannot... I cannot help others...

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:04.390
I cannot...

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.900
What?

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:01.140
You have successfully passed your test.

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:06.220
Becoming aware of your own weakness-

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:10.350
That was the test you had to overcome.

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:19.070
Now, go forth and extend a helping hand to the people of the world.

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:23.930
I will!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:33.270
<i>This is Glaris.</i>

00:23:33.270 --> 00:23:35.910
<i>Takius attempts to protect Fayon.</i>

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:40.410
<i>But her</i> Sensei<i>, Zephyrus, confuses her.</i>

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:42.950
<i>Next time,</i> "I've Known All Along."

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:45.350
<i>We await your next visit.</i>
